 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. LISTM.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01  N           PIC S9(3).
 01  HIGH-SCORE  PIC 9(3) VALUE 42.
 01  QUOTA       PIC 9(3) VALUE 7.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN-PARA.
     MOVE -5 TO N.
     DISPLAY "A13 " N.
     IF N < -1 DISPLAY "A13B OK" ELSE DISPLAY "A13B FAIL".
     ADD +3 TO N.
     DISPLAY "A13C " N.
     DISPLAY "A16 " HIGH-SCORE " " QUOTA.
     DISPLAY "A16B [" SPACE "]".
     STOP RUN.
